  m_text: Barnaby walked all the way to the big green apple tree. His paws made a
    crunchy sound on the grass. He looked up at the branches. Suddenly, a little
    blue bird flew down and landed on his head. "Barnaby, it's too small!" chirped
    the bird. The bird helped Barnaby pick a huge apple from the top branch.
